    },
    "summary": "Under **[Abilities in Attached Units](vsdata:core-rule/abilities-in-attached-units)**, once the models giving an attached unit an ability’s benefit are **destroyed**, the unit stops benefiting, whether they are Leader or Support models boosting their unit or bodyguard models boosting their leaders.\n\nIf those models are later revived, the abilities apply to the attached unit again.",
